WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
[Pangjie Bathhouse Welcomes You]

4
01:33.880 --> 01:35.520
What are you doing?

5
01:35.759 --> 01:37.520
You know what these things are,

6
01:37.520 --> 01:39.180
and you're throwing them out?

7
01:39.200 --> 01:40.360
These are antiques.

8
01:40.360 --> 01:42.120
What antiques? It's a bunch of junk.

9
01:42.120 --> 01:44.440
Why did you have to move back?

10
01:44.440 --> 01:46.479
You're getting old. I'm here to keep you company.

11
01:46.479 --> 01:47.200
To take care of you in your old age.

12
01:47.200 --> 01:48.320
Do I need your company?

13
01:48.320 --> 01:49.720
Because I've been single for so many years,

14
01:49.720 --> 01:50.840
I'm used to being alone.

15
01:50.840 --> 01:52.039
Suddenly having someone in the house,

16
01:52.039 --> 01:53.360
I'm not used to it.

17
01:53.360 --> 01:55.120
Then get used to it and deal with it.

18
01:55.120 --> 01:56.320
Tell me the truth.

19
01:56.400 --> 01:57.840
Are you struggling right now?

20
01:57.840 --> 01:59.200
Are you out of money for rent?

21
01:59.200 --> 02:00.400
What do you mean I have no money?

22
02:00.400 --> 02:01.560
The truth is,

23
02:01.560 --> 02:02.960
it's close to my law firm.

24
02:02.960 --> 02:04.360
It makes my commute easier.

25
02:04.360 --> 02:05.760
Don't just report the good news and hide the bad.

26
02:05.760 --> 02:07.480
If you weren't struggling, would you have sold your car?

27
02:07.480 --> 02:08.940
Would you have moved back?

28
02:10.280 --> 02:10.919
All right.

29
02:10.919 --> 02:12.400
We still have a mortgage on this house.

30
02:12.400 --> 02:13.960
If you really can't manage, just sell the house.

31
02:13.960 --> 02:14.960
Why would we sell the house?

32
02:14.960 --> 02:16.640
Stop worrying about money.

33
02:16.760 --> 02:18.120
No, if you're going to be like this,

34
02:18.120 --> 02:20.040
I have to find a job and make money.

35
02:20.079 --> 02:21.160
Just calm down.

36
02:21.520 --> 02:23.000
Do you know what the first rule is

37
02:23.000 --> 02:24.120
of being Xiao Longnv's dad?

38
02:24.120 --> 02:25.040
What?

39
02:25.040 --> 02:25.720
Don't ask,

40
02:25.960 --> 02:26.960
don't interfere,

41
02:27.040 --> 02:28.120
and just stay put.

42
02:30.720 --> 02:32.480
You...

43
02:32.680 --> 02:33.360
If you keep doing this,

44
02:33.360 --> 02:34.560
I really can't take it anymore.

45
02:34.560 --> 02:36.520
What did I do to you that you can't take it?

46
02:36.520 --> 02:37.360
All right.

47
02:38.160 --> 02:39.290
Where are you going?

48
02:41.800 --> 02:42.520
This...

49
02:50.880 --> 02:51.610
Stand still.

50
02:55.520 --> 02:57.320
What are you feeling guilty about now?

51
02:57.320 --> 02:59.180
Why are you reacting so strongly?

52
02:59.800 --> 03:00.320
No, Chief Li.

53
03:00.320 --> 03:01.800
What do you want?

54
03:01.800 --> 03:02.720
You're retired,

55
03:02.720 --> 03:04.040
and you still have this instinct.

56
03:04.040 --> 03:05.400
Are you using me to scratch that itch?

57
03:05.400 --> 03:06.320
Isn't your conditioned reflex

58
03:06.320 --> 03:07.240
quite accurate?

59
03:07.240 --> 03:09.040
Look at your surrendering posture.

60
03:09.040 --> 03:10.040
It's so perfect.

61
03:10.800 --> 03:11.880
All right, I forgive you.

62
03:11.880 --> 03:13.040
Keep me company. Let's go to your place for a drink.

63
03:13.040 --> 03:13.880
Let's go. Hurry.

64
03:13.880 --> 03:15.680
Drinking at this hour?

65
03:16.000 --> 03:16.960
We have to celebrate.

66
03:16.960 --> 03:17.620
Celebrate?

67
03:17.760 --> 03:19.200
Xiaolong moved back.

68
03:19.440 --> 03:20.120
What?

69
03:20.400 --> 03:21.800
Why did she move back?

70
03:22.040 --> 03:23.240
Is she short of money?

71
03:23.240 --> 03:24.440
If she is, I have some.

72
03:24.440 --> 03:25.440
With her temper,

73
03:25.520 --> 03:26.800
she wouldn't take your money even if you gave it to her.

74
03:26.800 --> 03:28.040
I mean me.

75
03:28.360 --> 03:29.880
My good days are over.

76
03:30.160 --> 03:31.560
Won't she act like a warden

77
03:31.560 --> 03:33.320
and restrict my personal freedom every day?

78
03:33.320 --> 03:34.720
What freedom do you want?

79
03:34.880 --> 03:36.440
Do you want to break the law

80
03:36.600 --> 03:37.520
at home or something?

81
03:37.520 --> 03:39.640
No, look at the sense of boundaries

82
03:39.640 --> 03:41.240
you have with Xiaoxin. It's perfect.

83
03:41.240 --> 03:42.240
Oh, come on.

84
03:42.400 --> 03:43.160
It's not even as good as

85
03:43.160 --> 03:44.800
the community sending warmth.

86
03:44.800 --> 03:45.320
When he comes to see me,

87
03:45.320 --> 03:46.440
he just brings a bag of things,

88
03:46.440 --> 03:47.280
puts it down,

89
03:47.600 --> 03:48.320
and turns around to leave,

90
03:48.320 --> 03:49.840
like he's throwing an explosive pack.

91
03:49.840 --> 03:50.560
Be content.

92
03:50.880 --> 03:51.880
Daughters are much better

93
03:51.880 --> 03:53.400
than sons.

94
03:54.240 --> 03:55.400
I want a son now.

95
03:56.040 --> 03:56.880
Do you still have time?

96
03:56.880 --> 03:57.880
It's too late.

97
04:09.440 --> 04:10.040
Come in.

98
04:12.400 --> 04:12.880
Director.

99
04:12.880 --> 04:13.540
Have a seat.

100
04:16.120 --> 04:17.320
Let me introduce you.

101
04:18.160 --> 04:18.680
This is

102
04:18.680 --> 04:19.940
Chairman Shao's wife,

103
04:20.040 --> 04:20.839
Ms. Zhong.

104
04:21.279 --> 04:23.440
This is the youngest senior partner at Honghu,

105
04:23.440 --> 04:23.880
Li Xin.

106
04:24.040 --> 04:25.040
Hello, Ms. Zhong.

107
04:26.040 --> 04:27.970
I've heard about the Wangang case.

108
04:28.040 --> 04:30.040
Mr. Wan and Old Shao are old friends.

109
04:30.360 --> 04:31.960
You're young and promising.

110
04:32.360 --> 04:33.600
You flatter me, Ms. Zhong.

111
04:33.600 --> 04:34.840
I've looked into Chairman Shao's case.

112
04:34.840 --> 04:35.440
Let's begin.

113
04:35.440 --> 04:36.400
Wait a moment.

114
04:36.640 --> 04:38.040
There's one more person.

115
04:38.640 --> 04:39.700
Don't get me wrong.

116
04:39.840 --> 04:41.770
It's not that I don't trust Honghu.

117
04:42.040 --> 04:44.640
It's just that Old Shao's case is of great importance.

118
04:44.640 --> 04:45.560
To be safe,

119
04:46.200 --> 04:48.840
I also hired a top lawyer from Beijing.

120
04:49.159 --> 04:52.040
He's very famous for handling

121
04:52.080 --> 04:54.320
organized crime and gang-related cases.

122
04:54.320 --> 04:55.050
Understood.

123
04:55.320 --> 04:57.180
Director Shao's case is a big one.

124
04:57.360 --> 04:59.220
It's good to have an extra helper.

125
05:00.360 --> 05:01.160
Come in.

126
05:04.160 --> 05:04.880
Sorry.

127
05:05.520 --> 05:06.520
The Justice Bureau in Beijing

128
05:06.520 --> 05:07.440
just called me

129
05:07.760 --> 05:08.760
to consult me on a problem.

130
05:08.760 --> 05:09.920
That's why I was delayed.

131
05:09.920 --> 05:10.680
I'm sorry.

132
05:10.960 --> 05:11.680
This is...

133
05:11.760 --> 05:13.600
This is Lawyer Qiu from Beijing.

134
05:14.240 --> 05:15.200
Qiu Minhai.

135
05:15.360 --> 05:15.960
Welcome.

136
05:16.480 --> 05:18.080
Top lawyers are always busy.

137
05:19.640 --> 05:20.440
This is Li Xin.

138
05:20.440 --> 05:21.320
He's in charge of this case.

139
05:21.320 --> 05:22.040
Nice to meet you.

140
05:22.040 --> 05:22.640
Nice to meet you.

141
05:22.640 --> 05:23.300
Have a seat.

142
05:34.920 --> 05:36.400
Then, Ms. Zhong, let's continue discussing the case.

143
05:36.400 --> 05:37.600
There's no need to discuss the case.

144
05:37.600 --> 05:39.280
I basically understand the situation.

145
05:39.280 --> 05:40.280
Let's save time

146
05:40.600 --> 05:42.400
and hear the family's thoughts.

147
05:42.560 --> 05:43.600
In our family,

148
05:43.840 --> 05:45.700
Lao Shao makes all the decisions.

149
05:46.040 --> 05:46.520
With him gone,

150
05:46.520 --> 05:48.640
I really don't know what to do.

151
05:49.080 --> 05:51.400
It hasn't been easy for Lao Shao these past few years.

152
05:51.400 --> 05:52.800
As the company has grown,

153
05:52.840 --> 05:54.640
there are some people and things

154
05:56.120 --> 05:57.780
that he simply can't control.

155
05:58.440 --> 05:59.320
As for organized crime,

156
05:59.320 --> 06:01.000
we certainly wouldn't dare.

157
06:01.760 --> 06:02.440
Of course.

158
06:03.080 --> 06:03.880
Rest assured,

159
06:03.960 --> 06:05.890
I'm confident in this type of case.

160
06:05.960 --> 06:07.400
I've been doing criminal defense for years.

161
06:07.400 --> 06:08.400
The students I teach

162
06:08.400 --> 06:09.880
have a consistently high win rate

163
06:09.880 --> 06:11.160
in these types of cases.

164
06:11.160 --> 06:12.040
Besides,

165
06:12.760 --> 06:16.200
we're all old friends with the police, prosecutors, and courts.

166
06:16.200 --> 06:16.960
Of course.

167
06:17.800 --> 06:18.760
You two know the local situation

168
06:18.760 --> 06:19.760
better than I do.

169
06:20.120 --> 06:21.840
Then for the subsequent procedures,

170
06:21.840 --> 06:23.640
I'll need Lawyer Li to assist me.

171
06:29.800 --> 06:30.600
No problem.

172
06:31.760 --> 06:32.360
Goodbye.

173
06:35.680 --> 06:37.159
My God, what a headache.

174
06:37.560 --> 06:39.120
Is he from Beijing?

175
06:39.920 --> 06:42.120
Monks from afar are better at chanting.

176
06:42.960 --> 06:43.760
For this case,

177
06:44.680 --> 06:46.280
we need to pay more attention.

178
06:46.280 --> 06:47.610
Don't worry, Director.

179
06:57.840 --> 06:58.920
I'm not afraid of having no answers,

180
06:58.920 --> 07:00.720
I'm only afraid it's not difficult.

181
07:00.720 --> 07:01.680
As long as you dare to ask,

182
07:01.680 --> 07:03.680
Lawyer Qiu will give you the answer.

183
07:03.800 --> 07:05.720
The case I'm going to talk about today is very...

184
07:05.720 --> 07:06.840
Lawyer Li, Lawyer Li.

185
07:06.840 --> 07:08.170
Did you watch the video?

186
07:08.720 --> 07:10.080
I investigated him immediately.

187
07:10.080 --> 07:12.240
Look, he has hundreds of thousands of followers.

188
07:12.240 --> 07:13.640
He's really impressive.

189
07:13.640 --> 07:15.040
He comes with ill intent.

190
07:21.880 --> 07:23.210
They are plain glasses.

191
07:23.520 --> 07:24.040
Yeah.

192
07:25.440 --> 07:26.700
These glasses of yours

193
07:26.920 --> 07:28.380
are indeed very handsome.

194
07:28.720 --> 07:29.600
Handsome.

195
07:29.800 --> 07:30.400
Handsome.

196
07:32.760 --> 07:34.159
If you need a lawyer, you can come to me anytime.

197
07:34.159 --> 07:35.840
Hello, if you need a lawyer... No, no.

198
07:35.840 --> 07:37.520
If you need a lawyer, come to me anytime.

199
07:37.520 --> 07:38.159
Hello.

200
07:38.400 --> 07:40.120
If you need a lawyer, you can come to me.

201
07:40.120 --> 07:40.880
Can you guarantee a win?

202
07:40.880 --> 07:42.560
I can't guarantee a win,

203
07:42.560 --> 07:43.360
but I will try my best.

204
07:43.360 --> 07:44.920
If you can't guarantee a win, why bother talking?

205
07:44.920 --> 07:46.720
Your professional skills aren't up to par.

206
07:46.720 --> 07:48.720
You have quite a temper, young man.

207
07:48.880 --> 07:52.480
You haven't learned your lesson even with such severe injuries.

208
07:52.560 --> 07:56.159
Lawyer Xiao, I understood everything from our last consultation.

209
07:56.159 --> 07:56.760
As for this case,

210
07:56.760 --> 07:59.490
I've thought about it and decided not to fight it.

211
08:03.440 --> 08:05.680
(Enforcement Bureau)

212
08:05.680 --> 08:07.600
Cheng Wei (Ruida Trade)

213
08:19.480 --> 08:20.320
Hello, Xiaolong.

214
08:20.320 --> 08:21.760
Hey, Li Xin, what do you mean?

215
08:21.760 --> 08:23.080
You're introducing a job to me?

216
08:23.080 --> 08:24.080
What kind of job?

217
08:24.320 --> 08:26.000
Those shady jobs of yours.

218
08:26.000 --> 08:27.720
Take a look in the mirror when you have time.

219
08:27.720 --> 08:29.440
Look at what you've become.

220
08:29.440 --> 08:30.600
Have you forgotten

221
08:30.600 --> 08:31.880
what you said yourself?

222
08:31.880 --> 08:34.320
What do you mean by roaming the world with swords together?

223
08:34.320 --> 08:35.380
Where are we going?

224
08:35.679 --> 08:37.120
I think I'll just send you flying.

225
08:37.120 --> 08:39.440
Believe it or not, I'll beat you down sooner or later.

226
08:39.440 --> 08:41.240
Believe it or not, I'll take all of you down.

227
08:41.240 --> 08:42.320
Do you think

228
08:42.320 --> 08:44.240
you did a good job with the Wangang incident

229
08:44.240 --> 08:45.560
and feel pretty proud of yourself?

230
08:45.560 --> 08:48.440
Let me tell you, it's never too late for a gentleman to take revenge.

231
08:48.440 --> 08:49.480
Just you wait.

232
08:49.960 --> 08:51.890
Look at what we'll be dealing with.

233
08:59.240 --> 09:00.680
Taotao Law Firm.

234
09:00.680 --> 09:01.920
What is this?

235
09:02.040 --> 09:03.280
Come to me for legal services.

236
09:03.280 --> 09:04.410
This is a reference.

237
09:04.440 --> 09:06.320
You can showcase your own style then.

238
09:06.320 --> 09:07.840
Don't you know how to use a sword, Sister?

239
09:07.840 --> 09:08.760
Take that sword,

240
09:08.760 --> 09:09.640
just take it out,

241
09:09.640 --> 09:10.640
and do some sword flourishes or something.

242
09:10.640 --> 09:11.880
I... What sword?

243
09:12.000 --> 09:13.000
Ours is the sword of justice.

244
09:13.000 --> 09:14.560
It's not about wielding real swords, okay?

245
09:14.560 --> 09:16.080
I... I can't do this kind of thing.

246
09:16.080 --> 09:18.200
Why are you so inflexible?

247
09:19.920 --> 09:22.960
It's not like I haven't waited for clients at the traffic police brigade.

248
09:22.960 --> 09:24.020
I'll go wait there.

249
09:24.520 --> 09:25.080
Sister, you...

250
09:25.080 --> 09:26.840
You can't go wait there anymore.

251
09:26.840 --> 09:27.960
Right now, our law firm's account

252
09:27.960 --> 09:28.960
has less than 10,000 yuan.

253
09:28.960 --> 09:30.280
We won't last two months, you know?

254
09:30.280 --> 09:31.760
Can't it last for another two months?

255
09:31.760 --> 09:32.160
Go away.

256
09:32.160 --> 09:33.090
Why are you so...

257
09:34.840 --> 09:35.280
Hello.

258
09:35.400 --> 09:35.880
Hello.

259
09:36.760 --> 09:38.280
Are you Lawyer Xiao?

260
09:38.600 --> 09:39.280
I am.

261
09:40.200 --> 09:41.280
You're here for a consultation, right?

262
09:41.280 --> 09:42.340
Please have a seat.

263
09:45.080 --> 09:46.440
Who says waiting for clients is useless?

264
09:46.440 --> 09:47.700
Hurry up and get ready.

265
09:50.320 --> 09:51.080
Hello, Lawyer Xiao.

266
09:51.080 --> 09:52.200
My name is Zhou Huan.

267
09:52.200 --> 09:53.440
This is my father-in-law.

268
09:53.440 --> 09:55.520
I have a case I'd like to entrust to you.

269
09:55.520 --> 09:56.180
It's not me.

270
09:56.440 --> 09:57.640
It's my wife.

271
09:58.040 --> 09:59.600
She's in the detention center right now.

272
09:59.600 --> 10:00.200
Lawyer.

273
10:00.200 --> 10:02.120
Please save my daughter.

274
10:02.800 --> 10:04.600
My daughter is locked up in the detention center,

275
10:04.600 --> 10:05.880
and they won't let her family see her.

276
10:05.880 --> 10:07.040
They said only...

277
10:07.520 --> 10:09.120
only a lawyer can see her.

278
10:09.160 --> 10:10.520
Don't worry, sir.

279
10:10.640 --> 10:13.160
Why don't you tell me the basic situation first?

280
10:13.160 --> 10:14.690
My wife's name is Yu Huihui.

281
10:15.160 --> 10:17.520
She's a branch manager of a wealth management company.

282
10:17.520 --> 10:19.720
They just collected a sum of money from the members.

283
10:19.720 --> 10:21.720
Then the head office, because of a financial loophole,

284
10:21.720 --> 10:22.520
was shut down.

285
10:22.760 --> 10:23.880
After those members heard the news,

286
10:23.880 --> 10:24.760
they called the police.

287
10:24.760 --> 10:26.820
My wife and the other branch managers

288
10:27.000 --> 10:28.200
were all arrested.

289
10:30.000 --> 10:31.960
This company is called Anding Wealth Management.

290
10:31.960 --> 10:33.420
It does asset management.

291
10:34.200 --> 10:35.480
This company

292
10:35.480 --> 10:37.240
has been very famous on the internet lately.

293
10:37.240 --> 10:39.480
The boss ran away abroad with 100 million.

294
10:39.480 --> 10:41.200
And everyone involved in this case

295
10:41.200 --> 10:42.240
was arrested.

296
10:42.360 --> 10:43.120
Actually, I used to

297
10:43.120 --> 10:44.520
work at this company too.

298
10:44.720 --> 10:45.480
Later I felt,

299
10:46.240 --> 10:48.170
anyway, something was just wrong.

300
10:48.240 --> 10:49.440
So I quit early.

301
10:49.680 --> 10:50.800
I also tried to persuade Huihui,

302
10:50.800 --> 10:52.400
but she just wouldn't leave.

303
10:52.480 --> 10:54.560
My child has been stubborn since she was little.

304
10:54.560 --> 10:56.760
When the police suddenly took her away,

305
10:57.200 --> 10:58.400
I was completely stunned.

306
10:58.400 --> 10:58.920
Dad.

307
10:58.920 --> 10:59.560
Don't worry.

308
10:59.560 --> 11:01.040
Your blood pressure will go up in a minute.

309
11:01.040 --> 11:02.040
Drink some water.

310
11:04.080 --> 11:04.810
Lawyer Xiao.

311
11:04.880 --> 11:07.400
That day I saw you handing out business cards at the hospital.

312
11:07.400 --> 11:08.800
I was picking up medicine for my dad.

313
11:08.800 --> 11:10.800
I thought you were very enthusiastic at the time,

314
11:10.800 --> 11:11.640
and very professional.

315
11:11.640 --> 11:13.640
I must find a good lawyer for my wife.

316
11:13.640 --> 11:14.570
So I wanted to see

317
11:14.720 --> 11:16.360
if you'd be willing to take this case

318
11:16.360 --> 11:17.240
and help us.

319
11:17.280 --> 11:18.120
Lawyer.

320
11:18.160 --> 11:19.080
I beg you.

321
11:19.080 --> 11:20.760
Please save my Huihui.

322
11:20.760 --> 11:22.040
Sir, don't worry.

323
11:22.240 --> 11:24.800
I will definitely do everything within the limits of the law

324
11:24.800 --> 11:27.320
to fight for the most favorable outcome for her.

325
11:27.320 --> 11:28.160
Thank you. Thank you.

326
11:28.160 --> 11:28.640
It's my duty. Thank you, thank you.

327
11:28.640 --> 11:30.100
It's my duty. It's my duty.

328
11:30.280 --> 11:31.010
Lawyer Xiao.

329
11:31.240 --> 11:32.700
I wrote a letter to Huihui.

330
11:33.000 --> 11:35.080
You know, she's in there all alone now,

331
11:35.080 --> 11:36.680
not eating or sleeping well.

332
11:36.760 --> 11:39.360
I'm really afraid she'll do something stupid,

333
11:39.360 --> 11:41.160
that she won't be able to hold on.

334
11:41.320 --> 11:43.640
Could you please help me give this to her?

335
11:44.600 --> 11:45.600
I'm sorry.

336
11:45.600 --> 11:47.120
I can't give her the letter.

337
11:47.120 --> 11:49.400
If it's convenient, I can take a look at the letter,

338
11:49.400 --> 11:51.160
and I'll relay the contents to her.

339
11:51.160 --> 11:52.280
That works. Okay.

340
11:52.400 --> 11:53.130
Lawyer Xiao.

341
11:54.360 --> 11:55.400
Here is 20,000 yuan.

342
11:55.400 --> 11:56.660
Please take it for now.

343
11:56.800 --> 11:59.520
Our Lawyer Xiao usually represents criminal cases,

344
11:59.520 --> 12:02.000
and the minimum for all stages is 50,000 yuan.

345
12:02.000 --> 12:02.760
It's fine.

346
12:03.040 --> 12:05.040
We can just pay in installments.

347
12:05.040 --> 12:06.000
Let's be flexible

348
12:06.000 --> 12:07.600
and discuss it with finance.

349
12:07.680 --> 12:10.000
After all, my uncle's case is so urgent.

350
12:11.760 --> 12:12.280
Okay.

351
12:12.560 --> 12:14.040
I'll discuss it with finance later.

352
12:14.040 --> 12:15.680
You should discuss it quickly.

353
12:15.680 --> 12:16.640
Please.

354
12:16.640 --> 12:17.600
No, no. Our whole family

355
12:17.600 --> 12:19.330
is very grateful to you. No, no.

356
12:19.440 --> 12:20.170
Sister Pang.

357
12:20.520 --> 12:21.580
This month's rent.

358
12:22.160 --> 12:23.400
What's the rush?

359
12:23.640 --> 12:25.040
You can pay when you have more money.

360
12:25.040 --> 12:25.840
I have plenty.

361
12:34.400 --> 12:35.040
Thank you.

362
12:38.480 --> 12:39.410
Okay, thank you.

363
12:39.480 --> 12:40.240
Come again.

364
12:50.880 --> 12:51.560
I have other things to do later.

365
12:51.560 --> 12:52.680
I have other arrangements there.

366
12:52.680 --> 12:54.600
How about this? You go to the company tomorrow.

367
12:54.600 --> 12:55.840
Call him Brother Ning from now on.

368
12:55.840 --> 12:56.640
Brother Ning,

369
12:56.640 --> 12:57.680
treat him like you treat me.

370
12:57.680 --> 12:59.760
You can easily make seven or eight million.

371
12:59.760 --> 13:00.560
Thank you, Brother Xin.

372
13:00.560 --> 13:01.720
Why call me Brother Xin?

373
13:01.720 --> 13:02.850
Just call me Jia Xin.

374
13:04.920 --> 13:05.560
What are you doing?

375
13:05.560 --> 13:06.400
You scared me.

376
13:06.400 --> 13:07.480
I'm saving you.

377
13:07.480 --> 13:08.440
Who wants to beat me up?

378
13:08.440 --> 13:10.000
What do you mean, who wants to beat you up?

379
13:10.000 --> 13:11.800
Didn't I figure out a way for you

380
13:11.960 --> 13:13.240
and give you a good plan?

381
13:13.240 --> 13:14.440
Why are you still doing this?

382
13:14.440 --> 13:15.080
If you go to jail again,

383
13:15.080 --> 13:16.200
what will Sister Pang do?

384
13:16.200 --> 13:17.320
What do you mean, I'll go to jail?

385
13:17.320 --> 13:18.850
What are you talking about?

386
13:19.320 --> 13:20.320
Dong Beihu,

387
13:20.480 --> 13:21.600
don't think that this durian

388
13:21.600 --> 13:22.840
isn't a weapon.

389
13:22.840 --> 13:24.840
It's still illegal if you hurt someone with it.

390
13:24.840 --> 13:26.560
Who am I going to hurt?

391
13:26.680 --> 13:28.410
Jia Xin loves durians the most.

392
13:32.200 --> 13:32.930
I'm leaving.

393
13:34.600 --> 13:36.130
You're giving him a durian?

394
13:36.600 --> 13:36.960
No.

395
13:36.960 --> 13:38.040
I find that you

396
13:38.040 --> 13:39.640
do things in a very weird way.

397
13:39.960 --> 13:40.600
If you're giving him a durian,

398
13:40.600 --> 13:41.800
just give it to him openly.

399
13:41.800 --> 13:43.280
I'm afraid he'll feel guilty

400
13:43.280 --> 13:44.560
and run away when he sees me.

401
13:44.560 --> 13:44.960
You

402
13:44.960 --> 13:46.960
just haven't changed your mindset.

403
13:46.960 --> 13:48.080
You have to treat Jia Xin

404
13:48.080 --> 13:49.720
as your savior.

405
13:49.720 --> 13:51.600
You have to be deeply grateful to him.

406
13:51.600 --> 13:52.600
Without him,

407
13:52.600 --> 13:54.160
there's no way to get you out.

408
13:54.160 --> 13:55.560
You need to have the attitude

409
13:55.560 --> 13:57.320
of working like a horse for him.

410
13:57.320 --> 13:58.440
Do you understand?

411
14:01.400 --> 14:01.960
Why do I feel like

412
14:01.960 --> 14:03.680
you look more like a scammer than Jia Xin?

413
14:03.680 --> 14:05.280
Is this how you talk to your benefactor?

414
14:05.280 --> 14:06.340
Fine. I'm leaving.

415
14:08.000 --> 14:08.800
Keep talking.

416
14:10.240 --> 14:11.500
Where are your things?

417
14:13.320 --> 14:14.200
Remember,

418
14:14.480 --> 14:15.760
Jia Xin's confession

419
14:15.760 --> 14:17.890
is the only useful evidence right now.

420
14:18.280 --> 14:20.240
You must make him say it himself

421
14:20.400 --> 14:22.530
that he took 200,000 from Sister Pang.

422
14:26.240 --> 14:26.970
Brother Xin.

423
14:31.680 --> 14:32.800
If it isn't Huzi.

424
14:33.320 --> 14:34.040
You're out.

425
14:34.200 --> 14:36.800
I couldn't have gotten out so fast without you.

426
14:37.200 --> 14:39.040
I asked a lot of people for help with your case.

427
14:39.040 --> 14:39.680
Say no more.

428
14:39.680 --> 14:40.400
Good brothers for life.

429
14:40.400 --> 14:41.000
Come here.

430
14:42.240 --> 14:42.800
You know,

431
14:42.800 --> 14:44.400
there's no need to hug when you're holding a durian.

432
14:44.400 --> 14:45.200
Don't you love eating it?

433
14:45.200 --> 14:45.840
Thank you.

434
14:45.960 --> 14:46.920
Here, let me carry your bag.

435
14:46.920 --> 14:48.160
Don't be so polite. We're not strangers.

436
14:48.160 --> 14:48.680
Come on, let's go.

437
14:48.680 --> 14:50.410
Let's talk upstairs. Let's go.

438
14:51.360 --> 14:52.040
Brother Xin.

439
14:52.040 --> 14:52.440
Let's go.

440
14:52.440 --> 14:53.880
Where are you going? Go inside.

441
14:53.880 --> 14:54.410
Let's go.

442
14:58.960 --> 15:00.080
What kind of tea do you want?

443
15:00.080 --> 15:01.140
I'll have milk tea.

444
15:02.480 --> 15:04.080
These are all antiques.

445
15:05.360 --> 15:07.000
These are national treasures.

446
15:07.000 --> 15:08.280
The Forbidden City has one, and you have one.

447
15:08.280 --> 15:10.600
The one in the Forbidden City doesn't have a lid, but yours does.

448
15:10.600 --> 15:12.130
Which dynasty is this from?

449
15:13.200 --> 15:14.560
What dynasty?

450
15:14.800 --> 15:16.600
It was fired in Songhua Village.

451
15:16.760 --> 15:17.890
This wooden turtle.

452
15:18.000 --> 15:19.280
It suits you so well.

453
15:19.480 --> 15:20.920
My second uncle dug it out from the back mountain.

454
15:20.920 --> 15:22.320
Sit down. Sit here.

455
15:23.120 --> 15:23.760
Xin.

456
15:25.040 --> 15:25.640
You suddenly

457
15:25.640 --> 15:27.160
started such a big business.

458
15:27.160 --> 15:27.760
I'm just

459
15:27.760 --> 15:29.120
working for someone else.

460
15:29.120 --> 15:30.480
The economy is bad now.

461
15:30.480 --> 15:31.480
Nothing is easy.

462
15:31.520 --> 15:32.800
Then I should repay you even more.

463
15:32.800 --> 15:33.680
From now on,

464
15:33.880 --> 15:36.480
I'll take care of all the chores inside and out.

465
15:38.120 --> 15:39.580
I appreciate the thought.

466
15:39.680 --> 15:41.160
But there's no need to repay me.

467
15:41.160 --> 15:41.680
No.

468
15:41.920 --> 15:42.850
What do you mean?

469
15:42.920 --> 15:44.640
Do you think I'm doing so badly

470
15:44.800 --> 15:45.360
that I'm a nobody,

471
15:45.360 --> 15:46.640
and you look down on me?

472
15:47.480 --> 15:49.120
What are you talking about?

473
15:51.560 --> 15:53.680
I just don't have anything for you to do.

474
15:53.680 --> 15:54.760
Why not?

475
15:54.760 --> 15:55.680
When you got out of the car just now,

476
15:55.680 --> 15:57.160
no one opened the door for you.

477
15:57.160 --> 15:58.520
I'll do that from now on.

478
15:58.760 --> 15:59.280
My

479
15:59.520 --> 16:01.880
status really isn't there yet.

480
16:01.880 --> 16:02.520
It is.

481
16:02.520 --> 16:03.760
It has been for a long time.

482
16:03.760 --> 16:05.200
Let's not talk about anything else.

483
16:05.200 --> 16:06.530
Just by helping me, Xin,

484
16:06.720 --> 16:07.520
you simply

485
16:07.720 --> 16:09.000
saved my life.

486
16:10.360 --> 16:11.320
You flatter me.

487
16:11.360 --> 16:11.960
Not at all.

488
16:12.040 --> 16:12.840
Have some tea.

489
16:14.280 --> 16:16.000
It's lunchtime.

490
16:16.040 --> 16:16.520
Sister Pang's place...

491
16:16.520 --> 16:17.320
I understand.

492
16:17.520 --> 16:18.640
I'll arrange it.

493
16:18.760 --> 16:19.760
I'll get some deli meat.

494
16:19.760 --> 16:21.420
And we can have a drink at noon.

495
16:22.920 --> 16:23.640
Museum.

496
16:27.280 --> 16:29.400
When you were not by my side,

497
16:29.560 --> 16:31.280
I often missed you.

498
16:33.160 --> 16:33.760
Too cheesy.

499
16:33.760 --> 16:34.760
In my heart.

500
16:36.040 --> 16:36.480
What is this?

501
16:36.480 --> 16:38.040
For the rest of my life, you are the snowstorm.

502
16:38.040 --> 16:39.280
You are the clear sky.

503
16:39.480 --> 16:40.680
The warmth and cold of the four seasons,

504
16:40.680 --> 16:41.640
it's all you.

505
16:42.040 --> 16:43.280
For my whole life,

506
16:43.880 --> 16:44.680
I only love you.

507
16:44.680 --> 16:45.210
Love who?

508
16:46.880 --> 16:47.840
What are you doing?

509
16:47.840 --> 16:49.370
Sneaking around like that.

510
16:51.440 --> 16:52.280
Sobered up?

511
16:53.000 --> 16:54.520
Professionals are forbidden to binge drink.

512
16:54.520 --> 16:55.680
It's not a good habit.

513
16:55.680 --> 16:56.600
Did I binge drink?

514
16:56.600 --> 16:58.130
Why do you have to be so mean?

515
16:58.280 --> 16:59.400
That was just a light drink.

516
16:59.400 --> 17:01.360
Everything is under my control.

517
17:01.520 --> 17:02.580
Alright, alright.

518
17:02.840 --> 17:04.119
Then do you remember what you said?

519
17:04.119 --> 17:05.000
Of course.

520
17:05.200 --> 17:05.839
Repeat it.

521
17:06.800 --> 17:07.319
I...

522
17:08.560 --> 17:09.960
Why should I repeat it for you?

523
17:09.960 --> 17:10.680
Lawyer Li.

524
17:12.839 --> 17:13.560
Who is it?

525
17:13.680 --> 17:15.210
More pretentious than you?

526
17:15.599 --> 17:17.280
Doesn't he still have to line up?

527
17:17.280 --> 17:17.640
Come.

528
18:18.160 --> 18:19.520
Tell me your thoughts.

529
18:20.240 --> 18:21.480
When can I get out?

530
18:22.920 --> 18:23.650
You go first.

531
18:23.880 --> 18:24.680
I'll add to it.

532
18:31.560 --> 18:32.560
Here's the thing.

533
18:33.040 --> 18:34.920
The public prosecution is currently charging you

534
18:34.920 --> 18:35.980
with eight crimes.

535
18:36.040 --> 18:37.920
The charges of organized crime are quite serious.

536
18:37.920 --> 18:38.960
For three of them,

537
18:39.080 --> 18:40.080
there is sufficient evidence.

538
18:40.080 --> 18:40.920
My advice is

539
18:41.960 --> 18:43.080
to plead guilty and accept the punishment.

540
18:43.080 --> 18:44.400
Do you think I'm guilty?

541
18:44.400 --> 18:45.600
Whether you are guilty

542
18:45.600 --> 18:47.520
is determined by the facts and evidence of the case.

543
18:47.520 --> 18:48.520
Bullshit.

544
18:48.760 --> 18:49.620
Let me tell you,

545
18:49.840 --> 18:52.000
I, Shao Yinhai, started my business in Leyang back in the day.

546
18:52.000 --> 18:54.530
You weren't even born when I dug my first mine.

547
18:54.840 --> 18:56.960
How many people have my mines fed over the decades?

548
18:56.960 --> 18:58.760
How many people has my enterprise fed?

549
18:58.760 --> 19:01.120
Do you know how much tax I've paid for Leyang?

550
19:01.120 --> 19:02.800
If you don't, go back and look it up.

551
19:02.800 --> 19:04.000
Now those people in the procuratorate

552
19:04.000 --> 19:05.360
just pin a few labels on me

553
19:05.360 --> 19:06.690
and say I'm in the mafia.

554
19:07.200 --> 19:08.480
When they needed me,

555
19:08.520 --> 19:10.280
they called me a successful entrepreneur.

556
19:10.280 --> 19:11.410
Now that they don't,

557
19:11.440 --> 19:13.360
they call me a criminal syndicate.

558
19:13.360 --> 19:15.120
Are you here to defend me

559
19:15.480 --> 19:16.800
or to convict me?

560
19:17.280 --> 19:18.040
Mr. Shao,

561
19:18.880 --> 19:19.800
your words

562
19:19.960 --> 19:21.290
hit the nail on the head.

563
19:21.520 --> 19:23.000
Back then, for economic development,

564
19:23.000 --> 19:24.720
the local government strongly supported mining.

565
19:24.720 --> 19:26.680
You actively responded to the call, right?

566
19:26.680 --> 19:27.920
But now they are making trouble for you.

567
19:27.920 --> 19:29.240
Isn't this discarding you after you've served your purpose?

568
19:29.240 --> 19:30.360
To put it bluntly,

569
19:30.520 --> 19:32.600
they are ignoring the big picture, right?

570
19:32.600 --> 19:33.360
Besides,

571
19:33.680 --> 19:36.210
a successful private entrepreneur like you,

572
19:36.240 --> 19:37.920
who is also a major taxpayer in Leyang,

573
19:37.920 --> 19:38.480
over the years,

574
19:38.480 --> 19:40.080
has contributed so much to the local area.

575
19:40.080 --> 19:41.000
If this were in ancient times,

576
19:41.000 --> 19:43.120
you would be a big shot

577
19:43.120 --> 19:44.680
like Shi Chong and Shen Wansan.

578
19:44.680 --> 19:45.920
I believe in this regard,

579
19:45.920 --> 19:48.580
the court will fully consider it no matter what.

580
19:50.440 --> 19:51.900
Xiao Li is young after all.

581
19:52.080 --> 19:53.840
I don't have much experience with this kind of case.

582
19:53.840 --> 19:54.760
But I think

583
19:54.920 --> 19:55.960
for our case,

584
19:56.040 --> 19:57.160
pleading not guilty

585
19:57.160 --> 19:58.620
is absolutely no problem.

586
19:58.640 --> 19:59.440
Attorney Qiu,

587
19:59.840 --> 20:01.370
tell us your specific plan.

588
20:02.480 --> 20:03.940
I've already prepared it.

589
20:08.200 --> 20:10.560
You are the snowstorm for the rest of my life,

590
20:10.560 --> 20:12.040
and the clear sky.

591
20:13.120 --> 20:15.720
You are the warmth and cold of the four seasons.

592
20:16.040 --> 20:18.080
I will love you for a lifetime.

593
20:19.040 --> 20:20.880
Life after life,

594
20:20.960 --> 20:22.760
my love will never change.

595
20:23.520 --> 20:25.520
That's pretty much what it means.

596
20:26.840 --> 20:28.360
Why are you doing this?

597
20:29.280 --> 20:30.760
It makes me want to cry.

598
20:31.520 --> 20:33.720
So how is my husband doing now?

599
20:33.920 --> 20:35.520
Has he lost or gained weight?

600
20:36.000 --> 20:37.800
I really don't know.

601
20:37.800 --> 20:39.040
I didn't know him before.

602
20:39.040 --> 20:40.480
I only saw him once.

603
20:40.720 --> 20:42.250
Let's get down to business.

604
20:43.440 --> 20:45.900
When did you join Anding Wealth Management?

605
20:46.200 --> 20:48.240
About seven or eight months ago.

606
20:49.040 --> 20:50.200
What should we do?

607
20:51.080 --> 20:53.040
Since we met,

608
20:53.840 --> 20:56.280
we've never been apart for this long.

609
20:56.600 --> 20:57.440
If I'm not around,

610
20:57.440 --> 20:58.720
he must have lost weight.

611
20:58.720 --> 20:59.600
Has he lost weight?

612
20:59.600 --> 21:01.040
I really don't know.

613
21:01.280 --> 21:02.440
Let's not talk about him.

614
21:02.440 --> 21:03.600
Let's talk about you.

615
21:03.600 --> 21:05.530
Isn't your situation more urgent?

616
21:05.680 --> 21:06.080
Right?

617
21:07.440 --> 21:07.960
Well...

618
21:08.400 --> 21:09.840
Did you know at the time

619
21:09.840 --> 21:12.370
that this job was suspected of being illegal?

620
21:12.560 --> 21:13.320
Now,

621
21:13.360 --> 21:14.560
Anding Wealth Management is suspected of

622
21:14.560 --> 21:16.800
illegally absorbing public deposits.

623
21:16.800 --> 21:17.880
As the store manager,

624
21:17.880 --> 21:19.640
you are liable for compensation.

625
21:19.640 --> 21:20.720
If you want to

626
21:20.720 --> 21:22.280
apply for bail pending trial now,

627
21:22.280 --> 21:23.280
you need to

628
21:23.280 --> 21:25.320
return all the income you earned

629
21:25.320 --> 21:26.560
during your employment.

630
21:26.560 --> 21:28.240
Does my husband know?

631
21:29.000 --> 21:30.920
Do I have to return all this money?

632
21:31.080 --> 21:32.680
Yu Huihui, here's the thing.

633
21:32.920 --> 21:33.760
Your husband

634
21:33.760 --> 21:34.920
has fully entrusted

635
21:34.920 --> 21:36.280
this case to me.

636
21:36.600 --> 21:37.320
I hope you

637
21:37.320 --> 21:39.320
will tell me everything you know

638
21:39.440 --> 21:40.280
about this case,

639
21:40.280 --> 21:41.080
holding nothing back.

640
21:41.080 --> 21:42.410
Only then can I help you.

641
21:42.680 --> 21:43.410
Understand?

642
21:44.240 --> 21:45.000
Speak.

643
21:46.360 --> 21:47.760
There's 1.2 million.

644
21:48.320 --> 21:49.520
1.2 million?

645
21:50.040 --> 21:51.100
What money is this?

646
21:51.720 --> 21:53.320
Is your income that high?

647
21:53.480 --> 21:55.320
Of course it's not income.

648
21:55.600 --> 21:58.360
It's the last big investment I collected from a member,

649
21:58.360 --> 22:00.520
and I haven't had time to transfer it to the company yet.

650
22:00.520 --> 22:02.280
Didn't the boss run away?

651
22:03.040 --> 22:04.570
The account is also frozen.

652
22:04.600 --> 22:05.280
Yu Huihui,

653
22:05.640 --> 22:07.480
you have to return this money immediately.

654
22:07.480 --> 22:09.810
The amount involved exceeds one million,

655
22:10.160 --> 22:12.000
which is considered extremely huge.

656
22:12.000 --> 22:12.800
If you don't return it,

657
22:12.800 --> 22:14.400
you're looking at a minimum of five years in prison.

658
22:14.400 --> 22:15.800
Does my husband know?

659
22:16.400 --> 22:17.400
What did he say?

660
22:17.600 --> 22:18.800
You are the client.

661
22:18.800 --> 22:20.640
Stop asking about your husband.

662
22:20.640 --> 22:22.120
What do you think?

663
22:22.120 --> 22:23.480
Then where is the money?

664
22:31.840 --> 22:32.680
Lawyer Xiao.

665
22:33.280 --> 22:34.280
Stop asking.

666
22:34.800 --> 22:36.720
My heart is pounding.

667
22:38.200 --> 22:39.480
I'm so confused.

668
22:45.920 --> 22:46.650
Lawyer Xiao.

669
22:48.960 --> 22:49.520
Is my wife doing okay?

670
22:49.520 --> 22:51.080
Did you read the letter to her?

671
22:51.080 --> 22:51.800
I did.

672
22:51.880 --> 22:53.560
She's doing fine.

673
22:54.400 --> 22:56.600
I noticed she listens to everything you say.

674
22:56.600 --> 22:58.720
So you know about the 1.2 million.

675
23:00.440 --> 23:02.770
I was too embarrassed to mention it to you.

676
23:02.840 --> 23:04.640
I didn't know how to ask you to tell Huihui.

677
23:04.640 --> 23:05.480
What happened?

678
23:05.480 --> 23:06.200
That money

679
23:06.640 --> 23:07.240
is now

680
23:07.640 --> 23:08.760
no longer in our hands.

681
23:08.760 --> 23:10.560
Huihui's aunt has terminal liver cancer.

682
23:10.560 --> 23:12.200
Treatment and a transplant cost over a million.

683
23:12.200 --> 23:14.320
I know very well that this money shouldn't be touched,

684
23:14.320 --> 23:15.360
but saving a life is more important.

685
23:15.360 --> 23:17.160
I had to lend the money out first.

686
23:17.400 --> 23:18.640
Then, for such an important matter,

687
23:18.640 --> 23:19.970
Yu Huihui doesn't know?

688
23:20.320 --> 23:22.120
Huihui is very close to her aunt.

689
23:22.240 --> 23:23.280
I was afraid that if she knew,

690
23:23.280 --> 23:25.340
she would have a harder time in there.

691
23:27.280 --> 23:27.880
Zhou Huan,

692
23:27.960 --> 23:30.000
let me make this clear to you.

693
23:30.240 --> 23:32.440
Yu Huihui misappropriated that money.

694
23:33.000 --> 23:35.200
Now it's not just illegal fundraising.

695
23:35.320 --> 23:37.760
She is suspected of misappropriating company funds.

696
23:37.760 --> 23:39.640
When the procuratorate indicts her,

697
23:39.640 --> 23:41.100
she will face two charges.

698
23:41.320 --> 23:42.320
The most important thing now

699
23:42.320 --> 23:44.000
is to pay back the 1.2 million.

700
23:44.360 --> 23:47.020
Only then can we help her get a lighter sentence.

701
23:47.160 --> 23:47.890
Don't worry.

702
23:47.920 --> 23:49.600
I will definitely find a way to return the money.

703
23:49.600 --> 23:50.480
As long as I can save Huihui,

704
23:50.480 --> 23:51.480
even if I have to sell everything I own,

705
23:51.480 --> 23:52.680
even if I go bankrupt,

706
23:52.680 --> 23:54.940
even if I have to sell myself, I will do it.

707
23:55.400 --> 23:56.240
Anyway,

708
23:56.240 --> 23:58.500
the maximum detention period is 37 days.

709
23:58.760 --> 24:00.280
There are about ten days left.

710
24:00.280 --> 24:02.200
Once the formal arrest is approved,

711
24:02.200 --> 24:05.130
it will be difficult to apply for bail pending trial.

712
24:05.800 --> 24:06.160
Okay.

713
24:06.720 --> 24:07.280
I'll figure something out.

714
24:07.280 --> 24:09.140
I'll go raise the money right now.

715
24:11.400 --> 24:13.800
I'll have to trouble Lawyer Li to assist me.

716
24:14.960 --> 24:15.620
Lawyer Qiu,

717
24:16.880 --> 24:17.880
do you think

718
24:18.120 --> 24:19.680
we can plead not guilty in this case,

719
24:19.680 --> 24:21.000
or do you think any case that comes to you

720
24:21.000 --> 24:22.460
can be pleaded not guilty?

721
24:24.960 --> 24:26.080
Go back and follow the timeline

722
24:26.080 --> 24:27.920
to organize the evidence materials for me.

723
24:27.920 --> 24:29.650
Hurry up. I'm waiting to see it.

724
24:31.240 --> 24:32.640
Okay. Don't worry.

725
24:41.240 --> 24:43.160
That little silk scarf is quite stylish.

726
24:43.160 --> 24:45.080
Since when did our great Lawyer Li

727
24:45.360 --> 24:46.680
ever assist anyone?

728
24:46.840 --> 24:47.640
That's really

729
24:47.720 --> 24:48.640
a joke.

730
24:51.480 --> 24:52.160
Let's go. Let's go together.

731
24:52.160 --> 24:52.960
I drove.

732
24:53.280 --> 24:54.720
Who doesn't have a car?

733
25:03.480 --> 25:05.000
I find you quite amusing.

734
25:05.200 --> 25:06.320
Is it because after retiring,

735
25:06.320 --> 25:07.760
you feel empty inside

736
25:08.000 --> 25:09.240
and can't stay at home?

737
25:09.240 --> 25:10.400
If I hadn't retired

738
25:10.720 --> 25:11.800
and didn't need to avoid suspicion,

739
25:11.800 --> 25:13.600
if you wanted to hang out with me,

740
25:14.080 --> 25:15.400
you wouldn't even have the chance.

741
25:15.400 --> 25:16.080
My god.

742
25:16.080 --> 25:17.680
What kind of big shot are you?

743
25:18.320 --> 25:20.160
Your police station had five deputy chiefs in total.

744
25:20.160 --> 25:21.620
You retired ranked fifth.

745
25:21.800 --> 25:23.320
You should thank me for that.

746
25:23.320 --> 25:25.320
You went from a lowly cop to a section chief.

747
25:25.320 --> 25:27.880
Every time you got promoted, it was because you caught me.

748
25:27.880 --> 25:28.520
You've got it backwards.

749
25:28.520 --> 25:30.080
I made a huge contribution.

750
25:30.080 --> 25:31.520
Who should be thanking whom?

751
25:31.520 --> 25:33.240
If I hadn't caught you in time

752
25:33.240 --> 25:35.040
and put you on the right path,

753
25:35.760 --> 25:37.840
you would have been shot eight times over.

754
25:37.840 --> 25:39.960
Next month, Xiaolong would be burning paper money for you

755
25:39.960 --> 25:41.490
for your 14th anniversary.

756
25:41.520 --> 25:43.480
I finally know who my daughter...

757
25:43.760 --> 25:44.720
Takes after.

758
25:44.840 --> 25:47.970
You've led her astray, making her talk so mean, you know?

759
25:48.560 --> 25:49.360
Come here.

760
25:49.640 --> 25:51.080
The son you think about day and night is back.

761
25:51.080 --> 25:52.540
Who's thinking about him?

762
25:55.240 --> 25:56.440
Isn't this Xiaolong?

763
25:56.560 --> 25:57.760
Xiaolong is back too.

764
26:00.960 --> 26:02.420
Look, they're at it again.

765
26:15.840 --> 26:17.300
Have you been busy lately?

766
26:17.640 --> 26:18.300
Not too bad.

767
26:18.840 --> 26:20.300
Are you eating here today?

768
26:20.560 --> 26:22.080
I won't be eating here today.

769
26:22.080 --> 26:23.360
I still have a lot of cases to work on.

770
26:23.360 --> 26:25.220
But I've already thawed the meat.

771
26:28.440 --> 26:30.300
If you're never going to eat here,

772
26:30.400 --> 26:31.730
don't buy so much stuff.

773
26:31.840 --> 26:33.520
Look how full the fridge is.

774
26:35.040 --> 26:36.770
I can't finish it all by myself.

775
26:43.640 --> 26:44.520
Dad, if there's nothing else,

776
26:44.520 --> 26:45.320
I'll get going.

777
26:45.320 --> 26:46.780
I still have a lot of cases.

778
26:47.440 --> 26:48.300
You're so busy.

779
26:48.440 --> 26:50.040
What case are you working on?

780
26:50.960 --> 26:52.120
An organized crime case.

781
26:52.120 --> 26:53.120
Organized crime?

782
26:56.840 --> 26:58.520
Is it Shao Yinhai's case?

783
26:59.520 --> 27:00.400
You know about it?

784
27:00.400 --> 27:02.160
How could you take this case?

785
27:03.080 --> 27:04.610
Back then, this Shao Yinhai

786
27:05.000 --> 27:07.280
occupied land for mining and carried out forced demolitions.

787
27:07.280 --> 27:08.880
He had people beaten bloody.

788
27:08.960 --> 27:10.360
When I responded to the call,

789
27:10.360 --> 27:11.490
I saw with my own eyes

790
27:11.560 --> 27:12.800
a person beaten to death,

791
27:12.800 --> 27:13.720
lying right there.

792
27:13.720 --> 27:15.160
He didn't beat that person.

793
27:15.160 --> 27:17.020
Of course he didn't do it himself.

794
27:17.080 --> 27:18.560
He directed it from behind the scenes.

795
27:18.560 --> 27:19.960
He instigated and organized it.

796
27:19.960 --> 27:21.600
They are an evil force.

797
27:22.600 --> 27:25.120
Legally, you need evidence to draw a conclusion.

798
27:25.120 --> 27:26.880
Could he be arrested without evidence?

799
27:26.880 --> 27:27.360
Dad,

800
27:27.720 --> 27:29.480
before the court makes a judgment,

801
27:29.480 --> 27:31.160
all accusations against him are just suspicions.

802
27:31.160 --> 27:32.160
Just suspicions.

803
27:32.200 --> 27:33.130
I'm warning you,

804
27:33.480 --> 27:34.720
you are Li Guochen's son.

805
27:34.720 --> 27:36.240
You absolutely cannot touch this case.

806
27:36.240 --> 27:37.520
This is a matter of principle.

807
27:37.520 --> 27:38.440
No, you have your principles,

808
27:38.440 --> 27:39.480
and I have mine.

809
27:39.920 --> 27:41.920
You're a police officer. Arresting people is fine.

810
27:41.920 --> 27:43.200
But I am a lawyer.

811
27:44.000 --> 27:45.840
My duty is to ensure my client

812
27:45.840 --> 27:48.280
receives a punishment that doesn't exceed the crime.

813
27:48.280 --> 27:49.280
This is my stance.

814
27:49.360 --> 27:50.680
My stance is

815
27:50.680 --> 27:53.080
that we can't help bad people get away with their crimes.

816
27:53.080 --> 27:54.880
No wonder Xiaolong ignores you.

817
27:55.680 --> 27:57.480
You should come here less often.

818
28:31.360 --> 28:32.080
Lawyer Li,

819
28:32.320 --> 28:33.850
it's been over ten minutes.

820
28:34.000 --> 28:36.080
Waiting like this isn't a solution.

821
28:36.200 --> 28:37.460
Should we start first?

822
28:39.320 --> 28:40.320
Wait a bit longer.

823
28:45.200 --> 28:46.200
Everyone's here.

824
28:46.360 --> 28:47.200
Lawyer Qiu,

825
28:47.360 --> 28:48.420
please have a seat.

826
28:53.600 --> 28:54.280
Come on,

827
28:54.680 --> 28:57.240
tell me about your progress these past few days.

828
28:57.240 --> 28:57.600
Lawyer Qiu.

829
28:57.600 --> 28:58.400
Wait a minute.

830
29:08.120 --> 29:09.320
Lawyer Qiu, our team

831
29:09.320 --> 29:11.000
has been discussing this case for the past few days.

832
29:11.000 --> 29:12.440
From an evidentiary perspective,

833
29:12.440 --> 29:13.920
it's indeed a bit difficult to plead not guilty.

834
29:13.920 --> 29:15.000
If it wasn't difficult,

835
29:15.000 --> 29:17.000
why would the client come to Honghu?

836
29:17.080 --> 29:18.480
Why would they come to me?

837
29:18.800 --> 29:20.000
Don't be afraid of difficulties.

838
29:20.000 --> 29:20.660
Difficulty

839
29:20.720 --> 29:22.240
is where the value lies.

840
29:23.440 --> 29:24.100
Lawyer Qiu.

841
29:24.280 --> 29:25.360
Take this for example,

842
29:25.360 --> 29:26.520
the crime of illegal business operations.

843
29:26.520 --> 29:27.520
Mr. Shao's company,

844
29:27.520 --> 29:30.120
without the approval of relevant departments,

845
29:30.120 --> 29:31.720
sold the mining license

846
29:31.720 --> 29:32.440
to two

847
29:32.440 --> 29:35.040
shell companies without any qualifications.

848
29:35.120 --> 29:37.240
The transfer contract and bank statements

849
29:37.240 --> 29:39.280
are right there in the file in black and white.

850
29:39.280 --> 29:40.080
Mr. Shao

851
29:41.000 --> 29:41.800
subjectively

852
29:42.080 --> 29:43.960
didn't know the buyers lacked qualifications

853
29:43.960 --> 29:45.600
and was deceived by the middleman.

854
29:45.600 --> 29:46.560
But the buyers' confessions

855
29:46.560 --> 29:48.600
have proven that Mr. Shao was fully aware,

856
29:48.600 --> 29:49.760
and the entire evidence collection process

857
29:49.760 --> 29:51.600
was completely legal and compliant.

858
29:51.600 --> 29:52.280
You guys

859
29:52.280 --> 29:53.960
are still too young, you know?

860
29:54.040 --> 29:55.920
You made a big case small.

861
29:56.760 --> 29:58.620
Turned a big case into a small one.

862
29:58.720 --> 29:59.280
Right.

863
30:00.120 --> 30:01.980
Turned a big case into a small one.

864
30:05.600 --> 30:07.600
Lawyer Qiu, we are indeed too young.

865
30:07.600 --> 30:09.720
We still need your guidance.

866
30:10.320 --> 30:11.000
Small cases.

867
30:11.000 --> 30:11.800
Sorry, sorry.

868
30:12.600 --> 30:14.000
I'll learn from this too.

869
30:18.000 --> 30:19.800
Small cases depend on evidence,

870
30:20.280 --> 30:22.040
medium cases depend on influence,

871
30:22.040 --> 30:23.900
and big cases depend on politics.

872
30:24.000 --> 30:27.000
In the face of absolute connections and political influence,

873
30:27.000 --> 30:28.720
How much use can the evidence be,

874
30:28.720 --> 30:29.280
right?

875
30:29.480 --> 30:31.600
Fixating on the account books and confessions

876
30:31.600 --> 30:33.600
is missing the forest for the trees.

877
30:33.600 --> 30:34.520
We need to broaden our perspective

878
30:34.520 --> 30:36.320
and look at this case from a higher vantage point.

879
30:36.320 --> 30:37.050
Understand?

880
30:37.280 --> 30:38.000
Be honest.

881
30:38.000 --> 30:38.730
Understood.

882
30:39.800 --> 30:41.260
You are absolutely right.

883
30:42.800 --> 30:43.600
Got it?

884
30:45.720 --> 30:47.040
Got it. I-I got it.

885
30:48.480 --> 30:49.120
Go on.

886
30:49.520 --> 30:50.560
Where should I continue from?

887
30:50.560 --> 30:51.690
Illegal detention.

888
30:51.960 --> 30:52.560
Go on.

889
30:54.280 --> 30:56.280
The interrogated person in the illegal detention case, Shi Lei,

890
30:56.280 --> 30:57.880
said this in the transcript.

891
31:07.760 --> 31:08.200
My god.

892
31:08.200 --> 31:09.720
What's that smell on you?

893
31:09.720 --> 31:11.200
Did you step in poop?

894
31:11.840 --> 31:13.200
That bastard Jia Xin

895
31:13.840 --> 31:15.360
and his bad crowd

896
31:15.520 --> 31:16.580
partied all night,

897
31:16.680 --> 31:18.040
shitting and throwing up.

898
31:18.040 --> 31:20.040
I cleaned the toilet all night.

899
31:20.040 --> 31:22.080
When have I ever suffered such a grievance?

900
31:22.080 --> 31:23.080
You infiltrated the enemy camp

901
31:23.080 --> 31:24.480
pretty deeply.

902
31:24.520 --> 31:25.980
Did he let you work for him?

903
31:26.280 --> 31:26.920
No.

904
31:27.840 --> 31:29.480
He's still very guarded against me.

905
31:29.480 --> 31:30.940
But that bastard recently

906
31:31.680 --> 31:33.080
is running a wealth management company.

907
31:33.080 --> 31:34.520
Just another way to make money.

908
31:34.520 --> 31:35.440
So I came up with a

909
31:35.440 --> 31:37.000
very targeted new trick

910
31:37.200 --> 31:38.920
to make him lower his guard.

911
31:38.960 --> 31:39.620
What trick?

912
31:40.680 --> 31:41.280
I plan to

913
31:41.480 --> 31:42.040
buy 180,000 yuan

914
31:42.040 --> 31:43.920
of wealth management products from him

915
31:43.920 --> 31:45.250
to support his business

916
31:45.480 --> 31:46.760
and show my loyalty.

917
31:46.920 --> 31:47.640
How much?

918
31:47.640 --> 31:48.440
180,000.

919
31:48.480 --> 31:49.760
Did cleaning the toilet

920
31:49.760 --> 31:51.200
make you stupid from the smell?

921
31:51.200 --> 31:52.440
You're still giving him money?

922
31:52.440 --> 31:54.100
You don't have to mock me here.

923
31:54.360 --> 31:55.960
I've figured it out. I'm going all out.

924
31:55.960 --> 31:57.160
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

925
31:57.160 --> 31:58.200
This undercover evidence collection

926
31:58.200 --> 31:59.860
must succeed. It cannot fail.

927
32:00.440 --> 32:01.440
If I fail,

928
32:02.120 --> 32:03.040
you'll go crazy too.

929
32:03.040 --> 32:04.700
What does it have to do with me?

930
32:04.720 --> 32:06.480
What? I gave you an idea and now you're blackmailing me?

931
32:06.480 --> 32:07.600
You're ridiculous.

932
32:07.600 --> 32:09.330
Then think about it carefully.

933
32:09.760 --> 32:11.360
Where did I get 180,000 yuan?

934
32:13.480 --> 32:14.740
Where did it come from?

935
32:17.040 --> 32:18.370
Did it fall from the sky?

936
32:19.680 --> 32:21.740
I mortgaged this two-story building

937
32:22.360 --> 32:24.200
for a micro-loan.

938
32:25.520 --> 32:27.560
Are you out of your mind?

939
32:27.680 --> 32:28.800
I just paid the rent.

940
32:28.800 --> 32:30.560
You mortgaged it without telling me.

941
32:30.560 --> 32:32.000
Do you know you breached the contract?

942
32:32.000 --> 32:32.800
I know.

943
32:32.800 --> 32:34.040
Calm down.

944
32:34.520 --> 32:36.200
At worst, I'll pay you the penalty.

945
32:36.200 --> 32:36.760
Anyway, we are now

946
32:36.760 --> 32:37.720
in the same boat.

947
32:37.720 --> 32:39.450
Who's in the same boat with you?

948
32:39.800 --> 32:42.040
You either pray that I succeed in collecting evidence,

949
32:42.040 --> 32:43.480
or you close down.

950
32:44.480 --> 32:45.340
We'll both die.

951
32:49.920 --> 32:51.040
Our company

952
32:51.280 --> 32:52.960
is currently on the rise.

953
32:53.200 --> 32:55.200
Things will get completely better soon.

954
32:55.200 --> 32:56.280
As for the bonuses,

955
32:56.360 --> 32:57.760
there's no need to sneak around

956
32:57.760 --> 32:59.000
and whisper behind my back.

957
32:59.000 --> 33:00.000
Whatever you deserve,

958
33:00.000 --> 33:01.040
I am the kind of person who...

959
33:01.040 --> 33:01.520
I...

960
33:03.480 --> 33:04.540
We're in a meeting.

961
33:05.000 --> 33:06.240
What are you looking at?

962
33:06.240 --> 33:07.040
Look at me.

963
33:07.360 --> 33:09.090
You all look so absent-minded.

964
33:19.520 --> 33:20.480
What's wrong, Brother Xin?

965
33:20.480 --> 33:21.480
Oh, my goodness.

966
33:21.800 --> 33:22.760
Do you have a permit for working at heights?

967
33:22.760 --> 33:23.760
And you just climbed up there?

968
33:23.760 --> 33:24.920
A fall from the third floor could kill you!

969
33:24.920 --> 33:25.560
It's fine, it's fine.

970
33:25.560 --> 33:27.040
I just thought I'd help clean the company's windows.

971
33:27.040 --> 33:28.320
I don't need you to clean them!

972
33:28.320 --> 33:29.280
Just go back to your work.

973
33:29.280 --> 33:30.520
No, you go to your meeting. It's fine.

974
33:30.520 --> 33:31.520
Someone, come here.

975
33:31.520 --> 33:32.240
No need. I still have to clean.

976
33:32.240 --> 33:32.900
Pull him in!

977
33:32.960 --> 33:34.480
I still have to clean that window.

978
33:34.480 --> 33:34.810
Wait.

979
33:35.120 --> 33:35.680
It's nothing.

980
33:35.680 --> 33:36.740
You're too polite.

981
33:36.960 --> 33:37.760
My heart! What are you doing?

982
33:37.760 --> 33:39.220
I just did a little work...

983
33:39.240 --> 33:39.960
Dong Beihu,

984
33:40.440 --> 33:41.770
you really are foolish.

985
33:42.040 --> 33:42.800
Look at you.

986
33:44.040 --> 33:45.370
What's your intention?

987
33:46.440 --> 33:47.360
No intention.

988
33:48.040 --> 33:50.040
I just see how successful you are now,

989
33:50.040 --> 33:51.480
and I got a little jealous.

990
33:51.480 --> 33:52.210
No, envious.

991
33:52.600 --> 33:53.530
So I was thinking

992
33:54.040 --> 33:55.360
about copying your success

993
33:55.360 --> 33:56.620
and learning from you.

994
33:56.960 --> 33:58.040
Then just say so.

995
33:58.080 --> 33:59.680
Why are you playing Spider-Man? Look at you.

996
33:59.680 --> 34:01.040
I was just embarrassed.

997
34:01.040 --> 34:02.440
Then... I'll just say it.

998
34:03.400 --> 34:04.160
In this card,

999
34:05.240 --> 34:06.480
there is 180,000 yuan.

1000
34:06.480 --> 34:07.940
I mortgaged my bathhouse.

1001
34:08.040 --> 34:09.280
I thought I'd buy some wealth management products,

1002
34:09.280 --> 34:10.739
and treat it as my tuition.

1003
34:12.040 --> 34:13.840
You really want to learn from me?

1004
34:15.920 --> 34:16.320
This

1005
34:17.400 --> 34:18.760
is my sincerity.

1006
34:18.880 --> 34:20.340
Stop pushing and pulling.

1007
34:22.760 --> 34:23.239
Then,

1008
34:23.400 --> 34:24.960
starting from the bottom,

1009
34:25.760 --> 34:26.620
can you take it?

1010
34:26.760 --> 34:28.280
I love a good challenge.

1011
34:28.719 --> 34:30.650
I'll do whatever Brother Xin says.

1012
34:31.040 --> 34:31.920
Dismissed.

1013
34:37.800 --> 34:39.280
No, what the hell is this?

1014
34:47.000 --> 34:48.060
Good morning, Xin.

1015
34:48.760 --> 34:50.000
What should I do today?

1016
34:50.000 --> 34:51.120
Come with me to the branch office.

1017
34:51.120 --> 34:51.780
Dong Beihu.

1018
34:53.480 --> 34:54.210
Understood.

1019
34:56.520 --> 34:57.280
Xin.

1020
34:58.480 --> 34:59.760
Fresh fruit just arrived.

1021
34:59.760 --> 35:00.290
Have one.

1022
35:02.000 --> 35:02.440
Xin.

1023
35:02.640 --> 35:04.240
It must have taken a lot of effort to get me out, right?

1024
35:04.240 --> 35:04.840
Dong Beihu.

1025
35:04.840 --> 35:05.520
Here.

1026
35:12.120 --> 35:13.040
Dong Beihu.

1027
35:13.560 --> 35:14.080
Here.

1028
35:14.600 --> 35:15.800
Let's make money together.

1029
35:15.800 --> 35:16.520
Got it, Xin.

1030
35:16.680 --> 35:17.140
Cheers.

1031
35:19.040 --> 35:19.640
Come on.

1032
35:19.920 --> 35:21.000
Drink up, drink up.

1033
35:21.120 --> 35:21.680
Come on.

1034
35:22.320 --> 35:22.840
Okay.

1035
35:24.680 --> 35:25.760
Xin, slow down.

1036
35:25.880 --> 35:27.280
Well, let me ask you, Xin.

1037
35:27.680 --> 35:29.800
Did you take 200,000 from my mom for my business?

1038
35:29.800 --> 35:30.280
I...

1039
35:33.240 --> 35:34.300
Xin, what's wrong?

1040
35:34.480 --> 35:35.400
Help Xin up.

1041
35:38.400 --> 35:39.120
Dong Beihu.

1042
35:39.400 --> 35:40.000
Here.

1043
35:40.320 --> 35:42.840
Deep in the dense forests south of 45 degrees north latitude,

1044
35:42.840 --> 35:44.480
there is a large feline,

1045
35:44.480 --> 35:45.610
the Siberian tiger.

1046
35:45.920 --> 35:46.480
Here.

1047
35:57.800 --> 35:59.200
Jia Xin.

1048
36:03.520 --> 36:04.000
Come in.

1049
36:07.200 --> 36:07.800
Coming.

1050
36:16.520 --> 36:18.450
How's the money collection going?

1051
36:22.600 --> 36:23.930
I'm sorry, Lawyer Xiao.

1052
36:24.360 --> 36:25.090
The money...

1053
36:26.000 --> 36:28.000
I'm afraid we can't get it together.

1054
36:29.320 --> 36:30.400
Can't get it together?

1055
36:30.400 --> 36:31.480
Does that mean

1056
36:31.680 --> 36:33.140
you're not paying it back?

1057
36:33.520 --> 36:35.600
If you don't return the stolen money during the investigation phase,

1058
36:35.600 --> 36:38.240
there's no chance of getting bail pending trial.

1059
36:38.240 --> 36:39.170
If we pay it back,

1060
36:39.720 --> 36:41.520
is bail guaranteed?

1061
36:42.040 --> 36:44.520
No one can guarantee it 100%.

1062
36:45.080 --> 36:47.160
But it's highly likely.

1063
36:47.480 --> 36:48.400
Is it possible

1064
36:50.160 --> 36:50.880
to pay less?

1065
36:51.080 --> 36:51.920
No.

1066
36:52.200 --> 36:53.360
Not a penny less.

1067
37:00.000 --> 37:02.040
Actually, I thought of another way.

1068
37:02.040 --> 37:03.160
Is it possible

1069
37:03.680 --> 37:04.600
for you

1070
37:05.360 --> 37:07.360
to pull some strings with the court?

1071
37:10.040 --> 37:10.640
Zhou Huan.

1072
37:10.960 --> 37:12.640
Let me remind you of something.

1073
37:12.640 --> 37:14.000
Interfering with judicial justice

1074
37:14.000 --> 37:15.320
is crossing the red line.

1075
37:15.320 --> 37:16.200
By suggesting this,

1076
37:16.200 --> 37:17.320
are you trying to help her

1077
37:17.320 --> 37:18.320
or harm her?

1078
37:18.800 --> 37:20.560
What nonsense am I saying?

1079
37:20.920 --> 37:22.160
Please don't be angry.

1080
37:22.160 --> 37:23.440
I won't mention it again.

1081
37:23.440 --> 37:24.120
I'm sorry.

1082
37:24.400 --> 37:26.240
I really want to get Huihui out.

1083
37:26.360 --> 37:27.240
But I...

1084
37:28.440 --> 37:29.900
I'll think of another way.

1085
37:30.200 --> 37:31.600
I'll think of something.

1086
37:36.320 --> 37:36.920
By the way,

1087
37:37.800 --> 37:39.200
how is Hui's aunt?

1088
37:39.360 --> 37:39.960
Her aunt?

1089
37:40.040 --> 37:41.960
She was transferred to Beijing for treatment.

1090
37:41.960 --> 37:43.880
I've been busy raising money lately,

1091
37:43.880 --> 37:45.880
so I haven't had time to check on her.

1092
37:46.800 --> 37:48.840
Misfortunes never come singly.

1093
37:54.200 --> 37:54.680
Sister,

1094
37:55.440 --> 37:56.040
tell me,

1095
37:56.440 --> 37:57.440
if we can't get the money,

1096
37:57.440 --> 37:59.100
what will happen to Yu Huihui?

1097
37:59.240 --> 38:01.440
Zhou Huan seems to love Yu Huihui so much.

1098
38:01.440 --> 38:03.240
Look how anxious he was just now.

1099
38:04.400 --> 38:05.520
Like you said,

1100
38:05.880 --> 38:07.640
he only seems to love her.

1101
38:08.320 --> 38:10.650
Looks like I need to talk to Uncle Yu alone.

1102
38:23.520 --> 38:24.200
Slow down.

1103
38:25.520 --> 38:27.640
It's worse than before.

1104
38:28.160 --> 38:30.720
You can't just ignore your health when you get a big case.

1105
38:30.720 --> 38:33.040
You still don't take such a severe old back injury seriously.

1106
38:33.040 --> 38:34.320
Come on, lie on your stomach.

1107
38:34.320 --> 38:36.580
Come here at least once a week from now on.

1108
38:40.520 --> 38:41.160
Lawyer Li.

1109
38:41.160 --> 38:42.560
I'll probably get drunk tonight.

1110
38:42.560 --> 38:44.280
Help me line up at the detention center tomorrow

1111
38:44.280 --> 38:45.080
to save time.

1112
38:46.520 --> 38:47.180
Lawyer Qiu.

1113
38:47.440 --> 38:48.300
This is Xiao Li.

1114
38:48.520 --> 38:49.280
I'm certainly willing

1115
38:49.280 --> 38:50.760
to help you line up at the detention center.

1116
38:50.760 --> 38:51.440
It's just that tomorrow,

1117
38:51.440 --> 38:53.640
I have a little work arrangement,

1118
38:53.960 --> 38:55.400
so I can't go with you.

1119
38:55.840 --> 38:56.770
But don't worry.

1120
38:56.800 --> 38:59.460
I'll definitely get everything you asked done.

1121
39:00.400 --> 39:02.000
Who is this guy?

1122
39:02.000 --> 39:03.530
Why are you so polite to him?

1123
39:04.720 --> 39:06.440
A Beijing uncle.

1124
39:20.200 --> 39:23.800
Lawyer Qiu said you couldn't make it today because you were busy.

1125
39:26.160 --> 39:27.020
Chairman Shao,

1126
39:27.560 --> 39:29.080
I want to talk to you alone.

1127
39:32.080 --> 39:32.800
Go ahead.

1128
39:33.320 --> 39:35.580
A complete not-guilty defense strategy

1129
39:35.720 --> 39:36.580
is impossible.

1130
39:37.040 --> 39:37.960
Reason?

1131
39:38.160 --> 39:40.560
Take the crime of picking quarrels and provoking trouble as an example.

1132
39:40.560 --> 39:41.840
In July 2015,

1133
39:42.040 --> 39:42.960
your subordinates

1134
39:42.960 --> 39:44.160
violently collected debts from Lao Zhang, a self-employed businessman,

1135
39:44.160 --> 39:45.960
multiple times.

1136
39:46.240 --> 39:48.880
There are 17 police dispatch records in the file.

1137
39:48.880 --> 39:50.000
In judicial practice,

1138
39:50.000 --> 39:51.040
three times is enough

1139
39:51.040 --> 39:52.840
to meet the standard for filing a criminal case.

1140
39:52.840 --> 39:54.000
The evidence is conclusive.

1141
39:54.000 --> 39:56.240
Fighting it to the end will only backfire.

1142
39:56.240 --> 39:57.800
If you refuse to plead guilty,

1143
39:57.800 --> 39:59.920
the consequence will be angering the judge,

1144
39:59.920 --> 40:02.180
bringing the risk of a maximum sentence.

1145
40:02.480 --> 40:03.400
Then tell me,

1146
40:03.960 --> 40:05.560
how do you want to fight this?

1147
40:06.920 --> 40:07.720
Illegal business operations,

1148
40:07.720 --> 40:08.680
falsely issuing invoices,

1149
40:08.680 --> 40:09.960
and picking quarrels and provoking trouble.

1150
40:09.960 --> 40:10.960
There is no room to fight

1151
40:10.960 --> 40:12.160
these three charges.

1152
40:12.720 --> 40:14.320
I suggest pleading guilty and accepting punishment

1153
40:14.320 --> 40:16.360
to establish a good attitude of admitting guilt.

1154
40:16.360 --> 40:18.240
As for the other violent crimes,

1155
40:18.960 --> 40:20.080
we should focus on fighting them

1156
40:20.080 --> 40:21.840
and try our best to prevent them from being classified,

1157
40:21.840 --> 40:26.440
to remove the major charge of organizing and leading a mafia-style organization.

1158
40:27.240 --> 40:28.100
Lawyer Qiu said

1159
40:28.560 --> 40:29.600
that my case

1160
40:29.720 --> 40:32.040
should be viewed from a higher dimension.

1161
40:32.040 --> 40:32.800
The court

1162
40:32.960 --> 40:34.360
doesn't just look at the case.

1163
40:34.360 --> 40:35.890
It also looks at the person.

1164
40:36.160 --> 40:37.360
Are my contributions

1165
40:37.400 --> 40:38.730
to Leyang over the years

1166
40:38.840 --> 40:40.000
just written off?

1167
40:40.320 --> 40:41.180
Chairman Shao,

1168
40:41.480 --> 40:42.720
Qin Shi Huang unified the six states

1169
40:42.720 --> 40:44.120
and built the Great Wall.

1170
40:45.560 --> 40:47.290
But that doesn't mean he didn't

1171
40:47.520 --> 40:49.480
burn books and bury scholars alive.

1172
40:49.480 --> 40:50.600
Flaws do not hide virtues,

1173
40:50.600 --> 40:52.160
and merits do not cover up faults.

1174
40:52.160 --> 40:54.040
If we fight according to my strategy

1175
40:54.040 --> 40:55.520
and remove the mafia label,

1176
40:55.520 --> 40:56.200
you are just

1177
40:56.200 --> 40:58.480
a private entrepreneur who made some mistakes.

1178
40:58.480 --> 41:00.000
But if you remain stubborn

1179
41:00.160 --> 41:01.960
and still fight for a not-guilty verdict,

1180
41:01.960 --> 41:02.960
once you fail,

1181
41:03.520 --> 41:04.200
you will be

1182
41:04.200 --> 41:07.080
a mafia boss in the guise of an entrepreneur,

1183
41:07.240 --> 41:08.520
an enemy of the people.

1184
41:09.800 --> 41:11.800
What's the use of paying so much tax?

1185
41:12.680 --> 41:13.400
It's just

1186
41:13.920 --> 41:15.780
evidence of funding evil forces.

1187
41:17.400 --> 41:18.880
Why should I trust you?

1188
41:19.960 --> 41:21.200
A junior lawyer

1189
41:21.760 --> 41:24.490
who hasn't been in this business for long, right?

1190
41:24.600 --> 41:26.400
You have seen the world.

1191
41:27.360 --> 41:28.960
You have to see the current situation

1192
41:28.960 --> 41:30.520
clearly for yourself.

1193
41:55.960 --> 41:56.690
Lawyer Xiao.

1194
41:57.200 --> 41:57.840
I'm sorry.

1195
41:57.840 --> 41:59.600
My father-in-law is not feeling well today,

1196
41:59.600 --> 42:01.130
so he asked me to come first.

1197
42:03.440 --> 42:04.240
I understand.

1198
42:04.480 --> 42:06.400
After all, Uncle Yu trusts you so much,

1199
42:06.400 --> 42:08.200
and you care about this case the most.

1200
42:08.200 --> 42:10.060
Is there any progress on our case?

1201
42:10.800 --> 42:11.330
Alright.

1202
42:15.640 --> 42:16.960
Speaking of progress,

1203
42:17.360 --> 42:19.480
things are indeed a bit troublesome.

1204
42:22.680 --> 42:24.680
It's all my fault for being useless.

1205
42:25.040 --> 42:26.640
I can't even save my own wife.

1206
42:27.400 --> 42:28.680
I'm just a loser.

1207
42:30.320 --> 42:32.180
It seems I can only accept my fate.

1208
42:32.240 --> 42:34.040
You can't just accept your fate.

1209
42:34.360 --> 42:35.880
Yu Huihui is my client.

1210
42:36.320 --> 42:37.980
She might not accept her fate.

1211
42:38.680 --> 42:39.520
Lawyer Xiao.

1212
42:39.960 --> 42:42.320
You don't need to feel too much pressure about this.

1213
42:42.320 --> 42:43.780
I don't feel any pressure.

1214
42:43.880 --> 42:45.400
But why do I feel like

1215
42:47.400 --> 42:49.560
you don't really want her to get out?
